  "steps": [
    {
      "use": "tell",
      "phase": "announce",
      "label": "the round begins",
      "to": "all",
      "text": "Round {round} of at most {max_rounds}. Sender: seat {sender}. Seat 1 face-up: Cockroach {players[0].face_cockroach}, Rat {players[0].face_rat}, Stinkbug {players[0].face_stinkbug}, Toad {players[0].face_toad}; hand {players[0].hand_size}. Seat 2 face-up: Cockroach {players[1].face_cockroach}, Rat {players[1].face_rat}, Stinkbug {players[1].face_stinkbug}, Toad {players[1].face_toad}; hand {players[1].hand_size}. Seat 3 face-up: Cockroach {players[2].face_cockroach}, Rat {players[2].face_rat}, Stinkbug {players[2].face_stinkbug}, Toad {players[2].face_toad}; hand {players[2].hand_size}. Your hand: {hand}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "send",
      "label": "the cards on offer",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "offer",
            "value": {
              "calc": "[c for c in ['Cockroach', 'Rat', 'Stinkbug', 'Toad'] if c in you.hand]"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "send",
      "label": "choose the card",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == sender"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": {
          "attribute": "offer"
        }
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "card"
      },
      "text": "You are the sender. Choose one card from your hand to pass face-down."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "send",
      "label": "the card leaves the hand",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "card_in_play",
            "value": "$card"
          }
        },
        {
          "remove": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "sender"
            },
            "key": "hand",
            "value": "$card"
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "sender"
            },
            "key": "hand_size",
            "value": -1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "send",
      "label": "make the claim",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == sender"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "Cockroach",
          "Rat",
          "Stinkbug",
          "Toad"
        ]
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "said_claim"
      },
      "text": "Claim which creature the card is. Your claim may be true or false."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "send",
      "label": "the claim is public",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "claim",
            "value": "$said_claim"
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {sender} claims the card is a {claim}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "send",
      "label": "choose the receiver",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == sender"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "player",
        "exclude_self": true
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "recv"
      },
      "text": "Choose which of the other two players receives the card."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "send",
      "label": "the receiver is named",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "receiver",
            "value": "$recv"
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {sender} passes the card to seat {receiver}, claiming it is a {claim}."
    },
    {
      "use": "ask",
      "phase": "call",
      "label": "call the claim",
      "to": {
        "where": "you.seat == receiver"
      },
      "answer": {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          "TRUE",
          "FALSE"
        ]
      },
      "verify": {
        "bind": "said_call"
      },
      "text": "Seat {sender} passes you a card and claims it is a {claim}. Call TRUE if you think it is a {claim}, or FALSE if you think it is not. If you are right, the sender takes it face-up; if you are wrong, you take it face-up."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "call",
      "label": "the call is made",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "call",
            "value": "$said_call"
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {receiver} calls {call}."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "the reveal",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "revealed_card",
            "value": {
              "calc": "card_in_play"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "taker",
            "value": {
              "calc": "sender if ((call == 'TRUE' and card_in_play == claim) or (call == 'FALSE' and card_in_play != claim)) else receiver"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "taker"
            },
            "key": "face_cockroach",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "revealed_card == 'Cockroach'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "taker"
            },
            "key": "face_rat",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "revealed_card == 'Rat'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "taker"
            },
            "key": "face_stinkbug",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "revealed_card == 'Stinkbug'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "taker"
            },
            "key": "face_toad",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "revealed_card == 'Toad'"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "player": {
              "calc": "taker"
            },
            "key": "face_total",
            "value": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "players": "all",
            "key": "max_face",
            "value": {
              "calc": "max([you.face_cockroach, you.face_rat, you.face_stinkbug, you.face_toad])"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "The card is revealed: it is a {revealed_card}. The claim was {claim} and the call was {call}. Seat {taker} takes the {revealed_card} face-up."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "reveal",
      "label": "the next sender",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "sender",
            "value": {
              "calc": "taker"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "text": "Seat {sender} will send next."
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "three of a creature",
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == taker and ((revealed_card == 'Cockroach' and you.face_cockroach >= loss_same_creature) or (revealed_card == 'Rat' and you.face_rat >= loss_same_creature) or (revealed_card == 'Stinkbug' and you.face_stinkbug >= loss_same_creature) or (revealed_card == 'Toad' and you.face_toad >= loss_same_creature))"
            },
            "key": "lost",
            "value": 1,
            "text": "Seat {player} has 3 face-up cards of one creature and loses."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "game_over",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "any(p.lost == 1 for p in players)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.lost == 1"
            },
            "to": "out"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "after the loss check",
      "when": {
        "calc": "game_over == 1"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "empty hand",
      "when": {
        "calc": "game_over == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.seat == sender and you.hand_size == 0"
            },
            "key": "lost",
            "value": 1,
            "text": "Seat {player} must send with an empty hand and loses."
          }
        },
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "game_over",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "any(p.lost == 1 for p in players)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "set_status": {
            "players": {
              "where": "you.lost == 1"
            },
            "to": "out"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "after the empty-hand check",
      "when": {
        "calc": "game_over == 1"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "update",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "the round ends",
      "when": {
        "calc": "game_over == 0"
      },
      "do": [
        {
          "set": {
            "key": "game_over",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "round >= max_rounds"
            },
            "text": "Round {max_rounds} has finished with no loser."
          }
        },
        {
          "adjust": {
            "key": "round",
            "value": 1,
            "if": {
              "calc": "game_over == 0"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "use": "check",
      "phase": "end",
      "label": "after the round",
      "when": {
        "calc": "game_over == 1"
      },
      "against": [
        "over"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "over": {
      "when": {
        "calc": "game_over == 1"
      },
      "rank_by": "(1 - you.lost) * 1000000 - you.face_total * 10000 - you.max_face * 100 + you.hand_size",
      "text": "Winner: {result}. Seat 1: lost {players[0].lost}, face-up {players[0].face_total}, most of one creature {players[0].max_face}, hand {players[0].hand_size}. Seat 2: lost {players[1].lost}, face-up {players[1].face_total}, most of one creature {players[1].max_face}, hand {players[1].hand_size}. Seat 3: lost {players[2].lost}, face-up {players[2].face_total}, most of one creature {players[2].max_face}, hand {players[2].hand_size}."
    }
  },
  "limits": {
    "rounds": 24,
    "rounds_max": 25,
    "actions_max": 1000,
    "deadline_s": 120
  },
  "rules": "The deck has {deck_size} cards: {creature_kinds} creatures (Cockroach, Rat, Stinkbug, Toad), {copies_per_creature} copies of each. It is shuffled and each of the 3 players is dealt {hand_size_start} cards face-down as a private hand. The remaining {aside_cards} cards are set aside face-down, unseen by anyone, for the whole game. Each player starts with no face-up cards. The first sender is chosen at random.\n\nEach round (at most {max_rounds} rounds):\n1. The round number, the sender, and every player's face-up cards (counts per creature) and hand size are announced.\n2. The sender privately chooses one card from their own hand.\n3. The sender chooses a claim: one of the 4 creatures. It may be true or false.\n4. The sender chooses a receiver: either of the other two players.\n5. The receiver, who sees the claim but not the card, calls TRUE (the card is the claimed creature) or FALSE (it is not).\n6. The card is revealed to everyone. The receiver is correct if they called TRUE and the card matches the claim, or called FALSE and it does not. If the receiver is correct, the sender takes the card face-up. If the receiver is wrong (called TRUE and it does not match, or called FALSE and it matches), the receiver takes it face-up. Either way, the card has left the sender's hand.\n7. The player who took the card face-up becomes the sender for the next round.\n8. Loss check: if the player who took the card now has {loss_same_creature} face-up cards of the same creature, that player LOSES and the game ends.\n9. Empty-hand check: if the next sender has no cards in hand, that player LOSES and the game ends.\n10. If round {max_rounds} has finished without a loser, the game ends with no loser.\n\nThere is no separate talk phase. The claim is the only message.\n\nEnding: the losing player (if any) cannot win. The players who did not lose are ranked by these tests in order: (a) fewest total face-up cards; (b) if tied, the smaller count of their single most common face-up creature; (c) if still tied, the most cards remaining in hand. The player ranked first wins. If the top players are tied on all three tests, the game is a draw between them."
}
